{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2023-04-04 07:30:00', 'title': 'BIOGEN APPOINTS ADAM KEENEY AS HEAD OF CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT', 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS., APRIL 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ADAM KEENEY, PH.D., AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT EFFECTIVE 17 APRIL 2023. DR. KEENEY WILL BE A MEMBER OF BIOGEN'S EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE REPORTING TO CHRISTOPHER A. VIEHBACHER, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER."}